  ('5b1194e9-fa66-88ff-80cb-a99a84d51501', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', '6ba9dbe4-3989-8b0a-949a-78dfebe173a4', 'Halcyon incident post-mortem', 'https://halcyon-bridge.example/blog/incident-2026-09-14', 'Halcyon Bridge (blog)', '2026-09-14T09:30:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T10:02:00.000Z', 'Confirmed', '0xd1be299975d66a0b8650976d0d77f2dc7b1b17a8', 'At 02:13 UTC an attacker submitted forged withdrawal proofs to the vault through a freshly deployed contract (0xd6adafbbb1a28fe26bc10b84c194f31f6d888aee). The proceeds were swept to 0xd1be299975d66a0b8650976d0d77f2dc7b1b17a8. We are working with exchanges and law enforcement and ask the community not to interact with these addresses.'),
  ('72c76975-b4c6-8934-b85d-e90d42ed5a4c', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', 'c318848b-56ce-8d86-989b-c72ebf970d0e', 'Halcyon incident post-mortem', 'https://halcyon-bridge.example/blog/incident-2026-09-14', 'Halcyon Bridge (blog)', '2026-09-14T09:30:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T10:02:00.000Z', 'Confirmed', '0xd6adafbbb1a28fe26bc10b84c194f31f6d888aee', 'At 02:13 UTC an attacker submitted forged withdrawal proofs to the vault through a freshly deployed contract (0xd6adafbbb1a28fe26bc10b84c194f31f6d888aee). The proceeds were swept to 0xd1be299975d66a0b8650976d0d77f2dc7b1b17a8. We are working with exchanges and law enforcement and ask the community not to interact with these addresses.'),
  ('06b4a6a7-c51c-801c-bb61-6883f6c42236', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', 'c84f9376-927b-8c58-a9e1-60e0351ce06a', 'Researcher thread tracking mixer deposits', 'https://social.example/@chainwatch_sam/status/1834410022', '@chainwatch_sam', '2026-09-14T04:12:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T04:40:00.000Z', 'Strong', '0xd9386e3283823dfd2ddf9b4a8a23c9fa285c6b6d', 'Halcyon exploiter is splitting funds. 0xd9386e3283823dfd2ddf9b4a8a23c9fa285c6b6d received 6,300 ETH from the exploiter and is now pushing 700 ETH chunks into the mixer pool. Three deposits so far. 0xd98f0ff6bc5896f9f4d3dd8afbbbac1f2a1e6b14 just bridged 3,800 ETH to Arbitrum.'),
  ('10c2b3f0-0e68-8f4c-8cfb-c00b3badab59', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', '79147a3c-65ab-8e69-a9a3-b87b03cef9fb', 'Researcher thread tracking mixer deposits', 'https://social.example/@chainwatch_sam/status/1834410022', '@chainwatch_sam', '2026-09-14T04:12:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T04:40:00.000Z', 'Strong', '0xd98f0ff6bc5896f9f4d3dd8afbbbac1f2a1e6b14', 'Halcyon exploiter is splitting funds. 0xd9386e3283823dfd2ddf9b4a8a23c9fa285c6b6d received 6,300 ETH from the exploiter and is now pushing 700 ETH chunks into the mixer pool. Three deposits so far. 0xd98f0ff6bc5896f9f4d3dd8afbbbac1f2a1e6b14 just bridged 3,800 ETH to Arbitrum.'),
  ('c149f14a-5075-887e-9609-84aa72b029ac', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', '6ba9dbe4-3989-8b0a-949a-78dfebe173a4', 'On-chain message from exploiter', 'https://explorer.example/tx/0x6d90652f045e213104bd55d45b5347f40d7562da05d9b7a06a6b5526d0a04def', 'Transaction input data', '2026-09-15T08:00:31.000Z', '2026-09-15T08:15:00.000Z', 'Confirmed', '0xd1be299975d66a0b8650976d0d77f2dc7b1b17a8', 'Decoded input data (UTF-8): "Halcyon team, we are open to returning 90% of funds under a whitehat agreement. Reply on-chain to this address within 72 hours."'),
  ('3fe92f1b-5b76-8934-a89d-406effa63767', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', 'feee527f-5642-810e-b082-fc27285bca5f', 'Forum post linking gas funder to earlier phishing', 'https://forum.example/t/same-gas-funder-as-2025-drainer/88213', 'forum.example user "0xgumshoe"', '2026-09-14T16:44:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T17:10:00.000Z', 'Weak', '0xd1ab6df3b2604f78f088fbf105393034b8cff59b', 'The wallet that topped up gas for the four Halcyon hop wallets (0xd1ab6df3b2604f78f088fbf105393034b8cff59b) looks like the same operator behind a 2025 drainer kit. Same gas pattern, same time of day. Not proof, but worth watching.'),
  ('7424e0d7-87e3-81b7-b5b0-7a5cb4b714fa', 'ea931542-133f-86c9-a6cd-3c87a270b628', '496ba06b-39ab-842a-844e-8b23b25f83af', 'Northgate deposit freeze notice', 'https://status.northgate.example/notices/2026-09-14-halcyon', 'Northgate Exchange status page', '2026-09-14T07:05:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T07:30:00.000Z', 'Strong', '0xd4545a369f1168de5303ac2b568f67734f749d27', 'Northgate has frozen 385 ETH credited to deposit address 0xd4545a369f1168de5303ac2b568f67734f749d27 following reports that the funds originate from the Halcyon Bridge incident. The account holder has been asked for source-of-funds documentation.'),
